Words the owner sees (example): "Sparkie couldn’t finish the change to its own code asked for on 2026-11-12: its tests still failed after 3 full runs. 5 test files still fail: change.test.mjs, door.test.mjs, fleet.test.mjs and 2 more. Nothing was installed. To try again, ask Sparkie in Spark Console. If the fault came with the last update, go back a build on Spark 2: bash ~/.local/share/spark-console/go-back.sh. If Spark Console won’t open: ~/.local/share/spark-console/RECOVERY.txt."

